  unitName: Vine Pike Lance
  unitId: 30012
  unitNumber: 10
  description: A pikeman from the ruined Principality of Vriksha, he later became
    one of the Six Heroes. Those who faced Lance during his training not only saw
    the power of Drevas, but were also in awe of his superior technique. Seeing such
    beautiful technique from such an inexperienced pikeman made him seem almost genius,
    but he hated being referred to in this way.
  summonDesc: Genius? I hate that word.<br>It denies my effort.<br>I'll show you
    what I mean.
  fusionDesc: I'm still inexperienced.<br>I must continue training.
  evoDesc: Look, Drevas.<br>We've become stronger.
  element: 3
  rarity: 2
